<p><span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/about-lei/how-to-get-an-lei-find-lei-issuing-organizations" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Legal Entity Identifier (LEI) issuing organizations</a></span> – also referred to as Local Operating Units (LOUs) – supply registration, renewal and other services, and act as the primary interface for legal entities wishing to obtain an LEI.</p>
<p>The GLEIF Concatenated Files contain LEI records and related reference data issued by the LEI issuing organizations.</p>
<p>Below you will find information on the latest status of the LEI issuing organizations' LEI data and whether it is included in the most recent <span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/lei-data/gleif-concatenated-file/download-the-concatenated-file">GLEIF Concatenated File download</a></span>.</p>
