<td style="text-align: left;">This organization has terminated its contractual relationship with GLEIF and will complete the transfer of its managed LEIs within one year.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2016-02-08</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.lei-strate.co.za" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Strate (Pty) Ltd (Strate)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is operational. Its source file will now be included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-12-22</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.ccilindia-lei.co.in/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Legal Entity Identifier India Limited (LEIL)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is now Legal Entity Identifier India Ltd and has changed its LEI from 335800CNVQFGRCP1PR55 to 335800FVH4MOKZS9VH40.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-11-17</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="https://www.justicia.lei.registradores.org" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Colegio de Registradores de la Propiedad, Mercantiles y Bienes Muebles de Espa&ntilde;a (CORPME)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its LEI from 95980000000000000000 to 959800R2X69K6Y6MX775.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-10-24</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">Registro de Identificación de Entidades del BCRA (Central Bank of Argentina LEI issuing organization)</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its LEI from 579100KKDDKIFCBKB036 to 579100KKDDKIFCBKB062.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-08-08</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.leiarabia.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Saudi Credit Bureau (SACB / Moa&#039;rif)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is now operational. Its source file will now be included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-07-03</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">Registro de Identificación de Entidades del BCRA (Central Bank of Argentina LEI issuing organization)</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is now operational. Its source file will now be included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-05-14</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">Zagrebačka burza d.d. (Zagreb Stock Exchange, ZSE)</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is now operational. Its source file will now be included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-05-13</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.lei-k.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Korea Securities Depository (KSD)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization's original source file is now included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-05-01</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">Brønnøysund Register Centre</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization made its daily original source file available for direct download via http.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-04-22</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.ccilindia-lei.co.in/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Legal Entity Identifier India Limited (LEIL)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization is now endorsed by the LEI Regulatory Oversight Committee and operational. Its source file will now be included in the daily concatenated file.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-04-18</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="https://www.prh.fi/en/leicodes.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Patentti- ja Rekisterihallitus (Finnish Patent and Registration Office (PRH))</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization switched from weekly to daily updates.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-04-02</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">Central Depository &amp; Settlement Co Ltd (CDS), Mauritius</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its original source files to validate correctly.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-04-01</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="https://www.isedirect.ie/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">The Irish Stock Exchange Plc (Irish Stock Exchange)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its original source files to validate correctly.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-04-01</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="https://www.leiturkey.com/com.takasbank.tvs.lei.web/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">İstanbul Takas ve Saklama Bankası Anonim Şirketi (Takasbank)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization has updated its terms of use for the LEI file download, so that its original source files can be included into the concatenated files. It will be included daily, from now on.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-03-18</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="http://www.kdpw.pl/en/Pages/Home_en.aspx" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Krajowy Depozyt Papier&oacute;w Wartościowych S.A. (KDPW)</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its original source files to validate correctly. Additionally, the LEI issuing organization made its original source files available for direct download via https.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-03-18</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span><a dir="ltr" href="https://www.jpx.co.jp/lei/en/index.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. (Japan Exchange Group/Tokyo Stock Exchange (JPX/TSE))</a></span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization switched from weekly to daily updates.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span style="white-space: nowrap">2015-03-18</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;"><span dir="ltr">London Stock Exchange LEI Limited (London Stock Exchange)</span></td>
<td style="text-align: left;">The LEI issuing organization changed its original source files to validate correctly.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p><br> GLEIF will periodically update this table as information is published by the LEI issuing organizations.</p>


